<h1>New Order</h1>

<p>Create a new order request for ice cream products.</p>

<section>
    <h2>Order checklist</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Select flavors and quantities.</li>
        <li>Choose preferred delivery date and time window.</li>
        <li>Add special handling notes (allergens, packaging).</li>
        <li>Submit the request for confirmation.</li>
    </ol>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Need help?</h2>
    <p>Contact support if you need guidance on bulk orders or custom flavors.</p>
</section>
